MINION 3
#TEST SOLCOUNT 3
# A variable repeated WITHIN the counted vector must be supported. [x,x]
# makes value v occur twice iff x=v, so p=#0=(2 if x=0 else 0) and
# q=#1=(2 if x=1 else 0): (x,p,q) in {(0,2,0),(1,0,2),(2,0,0)} = 3.

**VARIABLES**

DISCRETE x {0..2}
DISCRETE p {0..2}
DISCRETE q {0..2}

**SEARCH**

PRINT [[x],[p],[q]]

**CONSTRAINTS**

gcc([x,x], [0,1], [p,q])

**EOF**
